{
    "title": "Camera - Fast Snap with Filter",
    "description": "HD Camera is a free beauty camera and selfie camera designed to shoot photos and videos easily and fast. Highlighting the modern and vintage filters, our HD camera is your perfect choice to enhance the photo effect and make your photos attractive.\r\n\r\n<b>Features of HD camera</b>\r\n<b>Capture the beauty moments with filter camera</b>\r\nShoot photos, selfies, and videos in high definition, 4K\r\nVarious filters of modern and vintage style and artistic style\r\nBeauty filters for portraits, scenery, food, and objects\r\nAdjust the ratio of photos and set countdown timer for shooting\r\nProfessional setting for a scene, white balance, ISO, and automatic focus\r\nToggle the front and the rear camera\r\nTake a screenshot when shooting a video\r\nTouch the screen to capture fast\r\nFlash for shooting in the dark place\r\n\r\n<b>Considerate settings for HD camera</b>\r\nSet picture size and video quality for the front and the rear camera\r\nEnable selfie mirror mode to preview\r\nSave location information\r\nSet sound for countdown and shutter\r\n\r\n<b>Manage your photos in more ways</b>\r\nEasy to share, delete and jump to other editing platforms\r\nSet selected photo as wallpaper or contact photo\r\nMove to the safe box to protect your privacy\r\nAllow to copy, move and rename \r\nShow details of the photos, such as shooting time, location, and size\r\n\r\nEven if you are new to the camera app, our <b>HD camera, selfie camera and video camera</b> can help your shoot HD photos and videos without barriers. The HD camera is easy enough for a shooting newbie and practical enough for every shooting lover. Try it now and don\u2019t hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.",
    "descriptionHTML": "HD Camera is a free beauty camera and selfie camera designed to shoot photos and videos easily and fast. Highlighting the modern and vintage filters, our HD camera is your perfect choice to enhance the photo effect and make your photos attractive.<br><br><b>Features of HD camera</b><br><b>Capture the beauty moments with filter camera</b><br>Shoot photos, selfies, and videos in high definition, 4K<br>Various filters of modern and vintage style and artistic style<br>Beauty filters for portraits, scenery, food, and objects<br>Adjust the ratio of photos and set countdown timer for shooting<br>Professional setting for a scene, white balance, ISO, and automatic focus<br>Toggle the front and the rear camera<br>Take a screenshot when shooting a video<br>Touch the screen to capture fast<br>Flash for shooting in the dark place<br><br><b>Considerate settings for HD camera</b><br>Set picture size and video quality for the front and the rear camera<br>Enable selfie mirror mode to preview<br>Save location information<br>Set sound for countdown and shutter<br><br><b>Manage your photos in more ways</b><br>Easy to share, delete and jump to other editing platforms<br>Set selected photo as wallpaper or contact photo<br>Move to the safe box to protect your privacy<br>Allow to copy, move and rename <br>Show details of the photos, such as shooting time, location, and size<br><br>Even if you are new to the camera app, our <b>HD camera, selfie camera and video camera</b> can help your shoot HD photos and videos without barriers. The HD camera is easy enough for a shooting newbie and practical enough for every shooting lover. Try it now and don\u2019t hesitate to contact us if you have any questions.",
